    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/flick"
abstract: "Flickr bulk archiver in Python — downloads every public photo from a given username or profile URL at the largest available size via flickrapi, and writes a JSON sidecar per image with title, description, tags, date taken, GPS coordinates, and view count. Keys loaded from a .env file."
